 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Oguni no Koushaku Reijou wa Tekikoku nite Kakusei suru"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "小国の侯爵令嬢は敵国にて覚醒する"
   },
   {
    "en": "A Young Lady Finds Her True Calling Living with the Enemy"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "\"We asked not for a bride, but reparations for the war.\" She was to be married off to a general of an enemy nation... but upon her arrival, her future husband welcomed her with nothing but scorn and a cruel rejection!\n\nBertine, daughter of the chancellor of a small kingdom, is ordered by the king to marry Cecilio, the representative of the victors, as part of war reparations. Heartbroken, she crosses the sea, only to endure humiliating treatment by the general's servants. Yet rather than yield, she steps beyond the thresholds of her new home to carve out a path for herself in a hostile land. \"I cannot rely on my parents or my status. I will survive and become stronger.\"\n\nA love story born from misunderstanding and a deal. How will the bond between a noblewoman given away as solatium and the general of an enemy nation unfold?",
   "ja": "豊かな小国の宰相の娘として育った侯爵令嬢・ベルティーヌ。ところが結婚を目前に控えたある日、敗戦の賠償金と引き換えに敵国である連合国の代表・セシリオ将軍に嫁がされることに。しかし嫁いだ彼女を迎えたのは、夫の拒否と屈辱的な待遇。邸を飛び出した彼女は、親も身分も頼れない敵国で生きるための道を切り拓いていく──。"
  },
